	(text_box "When at the local thrift store I just had to spend $5 on a calculator that had \nstyle I loved. It was clean and in good shape and mostly worked but the screen \nsuffered from a couple dead lines in the dot matrix and I realized how slow those\ndevices were. So I decided it would be a fun project to get a new display put in\nit. Then, scope creep.\nNow we're puting finishing touches on a WiFi/BT linux powered touchscreen color \nlcd with USB-C charging LiPo batteries. Someday I may even get around to making\nit compute the sum of two integers"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 27.94 0)
		(size 93.98 20.32)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.397 1.397)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "71c311c6-0433-464c-b26e-fca205ae751d")
	)
